  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1121D"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-qoh5">
        <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e98">Caput 5</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_1@1-2">Ne temere, Deus.</quote>
            Quia omnia audit et videt, et stultitiam tuam arguit quamvis ipse in coelo, et tu in terra.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e113">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_2@1-1">Multas.</quote>
            Quasi sicut qui multa cogitat, ipsa frequenter somniat, sic in stultitiam recidit, qui ultra se, de Deo disputat. Vel, quia modo videmus per speculum et in aenigmate, quasi per somnum, aestimamus nos tenere, quod non habemus, et tamen nihil habemus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e124">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_3">Cum votum voveris.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-qoh5-Rd1e133"><name xml:id="gom-qoh5-Nd1e134" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e137">Melius est non promittere, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e139">usque ad, vapulabit multis plagis.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e143">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e145">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e147">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1122A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e151" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_4@1-1">Multoque.</quote>
            Sicut Judaei qui dixerunt: <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e154" source="http://scta.info/resource/ex24">Omnia quaecunque praecepit nobis Deus, faciemus<!-- check: cited chapter given; verse not identified --></quote>: et adoraverunt vitulum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e161">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e163">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e165">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e167" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_5@1-4">Ne dederis os tuum.</quote>
            Quasi ne dicas te ex infirmitate carnis tuae peccare, tanquam reflectens culpam in auctorem.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e171">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e173" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_5@12-13">Coram angelo.</quote>
            Qui astat unicuique, et omnia Deo nuntiat: ne putes omnia latere Deum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e178">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e180">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e182">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e184" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_6@1-3">Ubi multa sunt.</quote>
            Quasi, <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e187" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_5@1-4">Ne dederis os tuum,</quote> etc., quia haec vita est quasi somnia, et multa videntur vera, quae sunt falsa; sic et excusatio tua.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e194">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_7@1-3">Si videris calumnias.</quote>
            Ac si dicat: <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e201" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_5@11-16">Ne dicas coram angelo, non est Providentia:</quote> quod est contra eos qui omnia casibus agi putant, et Dei providentiam negant.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e205">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e207" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_7@1-1">Si</quote>
            tamen <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e210" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_7@2-4">videris calumnias egenorum,</quote> <pb ed="#P" n="1122B"/> etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e217">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e219">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e221">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e223" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_8@3-4">Universae terrae,</quote>
            etc. Deus patiens et redditor, qui dicit, <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e226" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps74_3@1-6">Cum accepero tempus, ego justitias judicabo.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e231">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e233">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_11@1-3">Dulcis est somnus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-qoh5-Rd1e240"><name xml:id="gom-qoh5-Nd1e241" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e244"><seg type="qs">Divitem avarum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quoniam ipsi Deum videbunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e253">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e255">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e257">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e259" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_12@1-4">Est et alia infirmitas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e262"><seg type="qs">Possumus haec de philosophis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cum scriptum sit: <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e268" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor1_19@4-6">Perdam sapientiam sapientium,</quote> etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-qoh5-Dd1e275">
          <head xml:id="gom-qoh5-Hd1e277">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-qoh5-d1e279">
            <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e281" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh5_17@1-6">Hoc itaque mihi visum est bonum,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-qoh5-Qd1e284"><seg type="qs">Melius dicit esse</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quam inspirat Dei gratia in adjuvando bona opera.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
